From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 19:22:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] systemd/networkmanager: keep modem connections over system
 sleep

NetworkManager deactivated mobile data before every suspend and
reconnected after the resume, with a new address each time. Patch 0002
leaves modem devices connected; ModemManager already puts the modem in
its quiet state for sleep. Package r3.

Also drop the Librem 5 Wi-Fi workaround patch, as Nura did in r2
(4d40287519), so that r3 is Nura r2 plus patch 0002.
